#~ msgid ""
#~ "Every figure here is arithmetic on Genesis 5:3–32. Two things fall out of "
#~ "it that no list can show: these ten lives overlap almost completely, and "
#~ "Methuselah's nine hundred and sixty-nine years run out in the year the "
#~ "flood comes."
